WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.393 --> 00:00:08.855
A great murder mystery unpeels
itself, like an onion.

00:00:08.855 --> 00:00:10.649
The secrets are the fun part.

00:00:10.649 --> 00:00:14.653
Sometimes it’s easier to figure
out someone else’s secret...

00:00:14.653 --> 00:00:16.446
then it is to deal with your own.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:23.620
♪♪

00:00:24.329 --> 00:00:26.414
We’re gonna go down there
and look around for clues.

00:00:26.414 --> 00:00:27.249
Want to come?

00:00:27.249 --> 00:00:29.251
Do I want to break into
a dead guy’s apartment

00:00:29.251 --> 00:00:31.294
and go through all his shit?

00:00:31.294 --> 00:00:32.295
Sounds like an afternoon.

